<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Curriculum Feasibility</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,600;9..144,900&family=Spline+Sans+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');
  :root{
    --bg:#0d0f11;--panel:#15181b;--panel2:#1c2024;--ink:#eef0f2;--dim:#959ea7;--line:#2a2f35;
    --fin:#3b6fe0;--ai:#11a87e;--soft:#c9883a;--none:#6b7480;
    --ok:#11a87e;--warn:#d9683f;--flag:#e0b341;--prereq:#c264d6;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  body{background:radial-gradient(900px 480px at 88% -12%,#1a2330 0,transparent 60%),var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:'Spline Sans Mono',monospace;padding:22px 18px 90px}
  h1{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:900;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .sub{color:var(--dim);font-size:11.5px;max-width:820px;line-height:1.5;margin:4px 0 14px}
  .layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:330px 1fr;gap:16px}
  @media(max-width:1000px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  /* filters + list */
  .side{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:13px;align-self:start;max-height:88vh;overflow-y:auto}
  .side h2{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}
  .filters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;margin-bottom:12px}
  .fbtn{font-size:10px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel2);color:var(--dim);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}
  .fbtn.on{background:var(--ai);border-color:var(--ai);color:#04130d;font-weight:600}
  .fbtn.elec.on{background:var(--fin);border-color:var(--fin);color:#fff}
  .course{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left-width:4px;border-radius:9px;padding:7px 9px;margin-bottom:6px;cursor:grab;user-select:none;position:relative}
  .course:active{cursor:grabbing}.course.dragging{opacity:.4}
  .course.fin{border-left-color:var(--fin)}.course.ai{border-left-color:var(--ai)}.course.soft{border-left-color:var(--soft)}.course.none{border-left-color:var(--none)}
  .course.placed{opacity:.3}
  .course .nm{font-size:11px;line-height:1.25;padding-right:30px}
  .course .meta{font-size:9px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:2px;letter-spacing:.04em}
  .course .ic{position:absolute;top:7px;right:8px;display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center}
  .pq{color:var(--prereq);font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
  .fl{color:var(--flag);font-size:11px}
  .course.flagship{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(224,179,65,.35)}
  /* board */
  .board{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:11px}
  @media(max-width:680px){.board{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .q{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px;min-height:90px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:border-color .14s,background .14s}
  .q h3{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline}
  .q .cnt{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--dim)}
  .q .drop{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;padding:3px;border-radius:7px;min-height:44px;margin-top:5px;transition:background .12s}
  .q.dragover.valid{border-color:var(--ok)}.q.dragover.valid .drop{background:rgba(17,168,126,.08)}
  .q.dragover.invalid{border-color:var(--warn)}.q.dragover.invalid .drop{background:rgba(217,104,63,.10)}
  .pc{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left-width:4px;border-radius:7px;padding:5px 7px;font-size:10.5px;cursor:grab;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:5px;position:relative}
  .pc.fin{border-left-color:var(--fin)}.pc.ai{border-left-color:var(--ai)}.pc.soft{border-left-color:var(--soft)}.pc.none{border-left-color:var(--none)}
  .pc .pcic{display:flex;gap:3px;align-items:center;flex-shrink:0}
  /* checks */
  .checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:14px}
  @media(max-width:900px){.checks{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .cbox{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 13px;font-size:11px}
  .cbox h2{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:7px}
  .ri{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:3px;font-size:10.5px}
  .ri .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;background:var(--warn)}
  .ri.met .dot{background:var(--ok)}.ri.met{color:var(--ink)}.ri:not(.met){color:var(--dim)}
  .summary{margin-top:7px;padding-top:7px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:11px;font-weight:600}
  .summary.ok{color:var(--ok)}.summary.no{color:var(--warn)}
  .flagcount{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:900;color:var(--flag)}
  .concbar{height:6px;background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;margin:3px 0 7px}
  .concbar .f{height:100%;background:var(--prereq)}
  .conc.met .concbar .f{background:var(--ok)}
  .conc{margin-bottom:8px;font-size:10.5px}
  .conc .t{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
  .conc.met .s{color:var(--ok)}.conc:not(.met) .s{color:var(--dim)}
  /* modal */
  .modal{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:80;padding:20px}
  .modal.show{display:flex}
  .modal .card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;max-width:440px;width:100%}
  .modal h3{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:4px}
  .modal .code{font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:10px}
  .modal .pqlist{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}
  .modal .pqlist .lab{color:var(--prereq);font-weight:600}
  .modal .x{float:right;cursor:pointer;color:var(--dim);font-size:18px;line-height:1}
  .toast{position:fixed;bottom:18px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(140%);background:var(--warn);color:#fff;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;transition:transform .25s;z-index:90}
  .toast.show{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)}
  .legend{font-size:10px;color:var(--dim);display:flex;gap:13px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:center}
  .legend .sw{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:3px;display:inline-block;margin-right:4px;vertical-align:-1px}
  .topbtns{display:flex;gap:7px}
  .btn{background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--dim);font-family:inherit;font-size:10.5px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer}
  .btn:hover{border-color:var(--dim);color:var(--ink)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px">
    <div><h1>Curriculum Feasibility</h1>
    <div class="sub">Filter courses by core area or electives, drag into any quarter where they're offered (rejected otherwise). Drag out or between quarters freely. Checks update live: core areas covered, 10-of-11 rule, your 3 concentrations, and flagship count. Courses with prereqs show a <span style="color:var(--prereq)">⬡</span> — click to see them.</div></div>
    <div class="topbtns"><button class="btn" id="clear">clear board</button></div>
  </div>

  <div class="legend">
    <span><span class="sw" style="background:var(--fin)"></span>Finance</span>
    <span><span class="sw" style="background:var(--ai)"></span>AI/Tech/Entrep</span>
    <span><span class="sw" style="background:var(--soft)"></span>Soft</span>
    <span><span class="sw" style="background:var(--none)"></span>Uncat.</span>
    <span><span style="color:var(--prereq)">⬡</span> has prereqs (click)</span>
    <span><span style="color:var(--flag)">★</span> flagship</span>
  </div>

  <div class="layout">
    <div class="side">
      <h2>Courses</h2>
      <div class="filters" id="filters"></div>
      <div id="courselist"></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="board" id="board"></div>
      <div class="checks">
        <div class="cbox">
          <h2>Core areas</h2>
          <div id="coreChecks"></div>
          <div class="summary" id="coreSummary"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cbox">
          <h2>Concentrations</h2>
          <div id="concChecks"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cbox">
          <h2>Flagship courses</h2>
          <div class="flagcount"><span id="flagN">0</span> <span style="font-size:12px;color:var(--dim)">/ 15 placed</span></div>
          <div id="flagList" style="font-size:10px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.5"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="modal" id="modal"><div class="card">
    <span class="x" id="modalX">×</span>
    <h3 id="mTitle"></h3><div class="code" id="mCode"></div>
    <div class="pqlist" id="mBody"></div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

